{"step":1,"type":"command","purpose":"展示完整应用信息、冲突后的其他故障域排期、不足额批次及有序未入选原因。","command":"go run ./cmd/darksafe plan plan.json","displayStartedAt":"2026-10-03T14:14:14.742937+00:00","executedAt":"2026-10-03T14:14:16.903330+00:00","endedAt":"2026-10-03T14:14:16.945180+00:00","cwdBefore":"/opt/gsb-fleet/workspaces/inst-31/verification/evaluation-rounds/1/record/inst-31-016/a","cwdAfter":"/opt/gsb-fleet/workspaces/inst-31/verification/evaluation-rounds/1/record/inst-31-016/a","exitCode":0,"timedOut":false,"started":true,"processId":1548554,"processGroupId":1548554,"shell":"bash","shellExecutable":"/usr/bin/bash","shellVersion":"5.2.21","nativeArgumentPassing":"argv","output":"{\n  \"app\": {\n    \"name\": \"payments\",\n    \"revision\": \"2026.10.0-r3\",\n    \"image\": \"registry.example.net/payments:2026.10.0-r3\"\n  },\n  \"batches\": [\n    {\n      \"index\": 1,\n      \"clusters\": [\n        \"east-1\",\n        \"north-1\",\n        \"south-1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"index\": 2,\n      \"clusters\": [\n        \"east-2\",\n        \"south-2\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"excluded\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"archived\",\n      \"reason\": \"集群已停用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"draining\",\n      \"reason\": \"命中排除条件\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"sandbox\",\n      \"reason\": \"未命中包含条件\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"staging\",\n      \"reason\": \"未命中包含条件\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","outputBase64":""}
{"step":2,"type":"command","purpose":"读取产品 README 的真实失败说明，呈现独立失败配置与从成功配置修改的文档差异。","command":"sed -n '/### .*两种失败结果/,/^## /p' README.md","displayStartedAt":"2026-10-03T14:14:21.201106+00:00","executedAt":"2026-10-03T14:14:23.248114+00:00","endedAt":"2026-10-03T14:14:23.250484+00:00","cwdBefore":"/opt/gsb-fleet/workspaces/inst-31/verification/evaluation-rounds/1/record/inst-31-016/a","cwdAfter":"/opt/gsb-fleet/workspaces/inst-31/verification/evaluation-rounds/1/record/inst-31-016/a","exitCode":0,"timedOut":false,"started":true,"processId":1549673,"processGroupId":1549673,"shell":"bash","shellExecutable":"/usr/bin/bash","shellVersion":"5.2.21","nativeArgumentPassing":"argv","output":"### 两种失败结果\n\n计划失败时**不会**产生部分计划：退出状态非零，标准错误说明具体问题，标准输出为空。\n\n#### 失败一：入选集群缺少故障域标签\n\n只要有任一**入选**集群缺少 `spreadBy` 指定的标签，整个计划失败。若有多个问题集群，错误只指出**标识最小**的那个，并带上缺失的标签名。保存以下配置为 `missing-tag.json`：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"app\": \"payments\",\n  \"revision\": \"2026.10.0-r3\",\n  \"image\": \"registry.example.net/payments:2026.10.0-r3\",\n  \"batchSize\": 3,\n  \"spreadBy\": \"zone\",\n  \"clusters\": [\n    {\"id\": \"cl-az2-n1\", \"tags\": {\"zone\": \"az2\"}},\n    {\"id\": \"cl-az1-n2\", \"tags\": {\"zone\": \"az1\"}},\n    {\"id\": \"cl-nozone-a\", \"tags\": {\"region\": \"cn-north\"}},\n    {\"id\": \"cl-az1-n1\", \"tags\": {\"zone\": \"az1\"}},\n    {\"id\": \"cl-nozone-b\", \"tags\": {\"rack\": \"r7\"}}\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n`cl-nozone-a` 与 `cl-nozone-b` 都缺少 `zone` 标签，标准错误为（指出标签 `zone` 和标识最小的 `cl-nozone-a`，不提及 `cl-nozone-b`）：\n\n```text\n集群 \"cl-nozone-a\" 缺少故障域标签 \"zone\"\n```\n\n#### 失败二：所有候选都被筛掉\n\n当筛选后没有任何集群入选时，**不会成功返回一份空批次的计划**，而是失败并在标准错误中按标识升序列出每个候选集群的未入选原因。保存以下配置为 `all-filtered.json`：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"app\": \"payments\",\n  \"revision\": \"2026.10.0-r3\",\n  \"image\": \"registry.example.net/payments:2026.10.0-r3\",\n  \"batchSize\": 2,\n  \"include\": [\n    {\"env\": \"prod\"}\n  ],\n  \"exclude\": [\n    {\"drain\": \"true\"}\n  ],\n  \"clusters\": [\n    {\"id\": \"cl-x\", \"disabled\": true, \"tags\": {\"env\": \"prod\"}},\n    {\"id\": \"cl-a\", \"tags\": {\"env\": \"dev\"}},\n    {\"id\": \"cl-b\", \"tags\": {\"env\": \"prod\", \"drain\": \"true\"}}\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n标准错误为：\n\n```text\n没有符合规则的可用集群，各候选集群未入选原因：\n  cl-a：未命中包含条件\n  cl-b：命中排除条件\n  cl-x：集群已停用\n```\n\n注意停用的 `cl-x` 没有任何故障域标签也无关紧要——它先被“停用”筛掉，不进入标签检查。\n\n### 输出与退出状态小结\n\n| 结果 | 退出状态 | 标准输出 | 标准错误 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 计划成功 | `0` | 只有完整计划（`app`、从 1 连续编号的 `batches`、按标识升序的 `excluded`） | 为空 |\n| 计划失败（配置不合法、缺少故障域标签、无集群入选等） | 非零 | 为空 | 说明具体问题 |\n\n## 技术方向\n","outputBase64":""}
